<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson 9 mo profits match market hopes.</title>
<headline>Ericsson 9 mo profits match market hopes.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms giant LM Ericsson AB on Tuesday posted a 30 percent rise in nine month pre-tax profit to 6.26 billion Swedish crowns ($954 million) in line with market expectations but said a strong crown had cut earnings by almost 700 million crowns.</p>
</text>
